From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mingyang Li <594058+tslmy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:07:30 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] phy: qcom: qmp-combo: don't disable the pipe clock when
 USB power-on fails

Since commit f546912bcac6 ("phy: qcom: qmp-combo: Move pipe_clk on/off
to common"), qmp_combo_com_init() enables the USB pipe clock and
qmp_combo_com_exit() disables it. The PHYSTATUS timeout path in
qmp_combo_usb_power_on() still disables it, though.

qmp_combo_usb_init() follows the failure with qmp_combo_com_exit(),
so the pipe clock gets disabled twice:

  qcom-qmp-combo-phy 88e8000.phy: phy initialization timed-out
  gcc_usb3_prim_phy_pipe_clk already disabled
  WARNING: drivers/clk/clk.c:1188 at clk_core_disable+0x2a0/0x310
   qmp_combo_com_exit
   qmp_combo_usb_init
   phy_init
  gcc_usb3_prim_phy_pipe_clk already unprepared

When the failure comes from qmp_combo_typec_switch_set() or
qmp_combo_typec_mux_set() instead, the common reference stays held,
but the pipe clock is now off. USB 2.0 still needs that clock in
DP-only mode. Then the next qmp_combo_com_exit() underflows it.

Leave the pipe clock to the common code.

Fixes: f546912bcac6 ("phy: qcom: qmp-combo: Move pipe_clk on/off to common")
Signed-off-by: Mingyang Li <594058+tslmy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c | 7 +------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
index 5600d22..8ab3aaa 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -3879,15 +3879,10 @@ static int qmp_combo_usb_power_on(struct phy *phy)
 			PHY_INIT_COMPLETE_TIMEOUT);
 	if (ret) {
 		dev_err(qmp->dev, "phy initialization timed-out\n");
-		goto err_disable_pipe_clk;
+		return ret;
 	}
 
 	return 0;
-
-err_disable_pipe_clk:
-	clk_disable_unprepare(qmp->pipe_clk);
-
-	return ret;
 }
 
 static int qmp_combo_usb_power_off(struct phy *phy)
